  "description": "VOGYIC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H120 Er4 N12 O16,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er1A (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.520-3.804 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.91-111.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C132H126Er4N14O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
